{"unit_id":"798645706__dsh-strawberry-data-hub#feature-1","repo":"798645706/dsh-strawberry-data-hub","commit":"253e11fa97f535354d8b88a1407e1ab995b7b2b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Strawberry Data Hub 的功能「文献检索」：根据研究问题检索草莓研究证据，并保留引用、材料、条件和不确定性；通过 sdh_literature_search 触发，返回来源记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/contracts.js:14-19"]}
{"unit_id":"798645706__dsh-strawberry-data-hub#feature-2","repo":"798645706/dsh-strawberry-data-hub","commit":"253e11fa97f535354d8b88a1407e1ab995b7b2b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Strawberry Data Hub 的功能「基因解析与上下文」：先按精确基因 ID 解析物种和组装候选，再用准确键查询注释及可用多组学证据；歧义时由用户选择候选。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/contracts.js:21-28"]}
